"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initialize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"withChannelKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"channelKey","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"messagingFactory","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MessagingFactory","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.zendesk.Zendesk\/documentation\/ZendeskSDK\/MessagingFactory","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@ZendeskSDK@objc(pl)MessagingFactory"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"locale","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Zendesk","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.zendesk.Zendesk\/documentation\/ZendeskSDK\/Zendesk","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@ZendeskSDK@objc(cs)Zendesk"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"channelKey","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The key of your Messaging iOS channel","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"messagingFactory","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional parameter to include the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Messaging"},{"type":"text","text":" capability, pass an initialized "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DefaultMessagingFactory"},{"type":"text","text":" here."}]}]},{"name":"locale","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional locale override (e.g. “en-US”) to use instead of the device’s language."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An empty string or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" uses the device’s language. The value is trimmed and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"canonicalized before use, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"EN\""},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"en\""},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"En\""},{"type":"text","text":" are equivalent and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"en_US\""},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accepted as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"en-US\""},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["    The locale is fixed for the lifetime of the returned instance. Passing a different `locale` for an","    already initialized `channelKey` has no effect - call `Zendesk.invalidate()` first, then `initialize`","    with the new locale.","","    Backend content — bot replies, settings and campaigns — follows this locale, as does the","    UIKit messaging interface (labels, buttons, error messages, VoiceOver descriptions, dates and","    plural forms). Lookup falls back from an exact match (`\"en-AU\"`) to the closest available","    translation (`\"en-GB\"`) and finally to the SDK's built-in English. Your app's own string","    overrides in `Bundle.main` continue to take precedence for the chosen locale.","","    Some things deliberately keep following the device: layout *direction*, Help Center article","    *content*, the Zendesk Voice SDK interface, and regional formatting (calendar, number separators,","    file-size units)."]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Zendesk"},{"text":" instance will be returned.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor"